# The provisioning scripts and their SQL are mounted into a Linux container and
# executed by busybox `sh` and `psql`. This repo is developed on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true, which would hand the container CRLF files — `provision.sh`
# then dies on a stray \r and the whole stack refuses to start, with an error
# that points nowhere near the cause. Pin them.
postgres/**/*.sh   text eol=lf
postgres/**/*.sql  text eol=lf
